{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1787301214825802001,"compiled_state":{"alias":"far-deistic-dowitcher","assignee":null,"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","authorship":{"signed":3,"unsigned":0},"authorship_ledger":[{"content_hash":"5514c681624b44962a356a99d7d4f3f8c5823ad3e54d7d8d3409d4535fea201f","event_uuid":"f0a71275-873e-482b-96f2-bb6cdb3b49d9","position":{"commit_sha":"23e05871907040eb45b2f99011a28deca1407fcc","position":"1787290326333999001-f0a71275-873e-482b-96f2-bb6cdb3b49d9"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"d9aebae3aabd7372810e4c455b49a3902a2e8bcc9613b014a85820ef1d910c5c","event_uuid":"492cf506-9df7-4710-a4bf-0b887152031e","position":{"commit_sha":"e6a7caf9d5050c78bf0060585224fe46b530f24a","position":"1787290438011076001-492cf506-9df7-4710-a4bf-0b887152031e"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"a18db0d17e5d23ed59bcb149f5de75cdcc52ed5a8324be5dbba5b07b21f4d99b","event_uuid":"7b5dbb98-9ddb-43a7-94d5-51b7f3a66213","position":{"commit_sha":"40fe330c47f095c9c413d8c26caef67a7f65e909","position":"1787290504816637001-7b5dbb98-9ddb-43a7-94d5-51b7f3a66213"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1787290326333999001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"7b5dbb98-9ddb-43a7-94d5-51b7f3a66213","relation":"depends_on","target_id":"438a-e1d9-29d3-4081"}],"description":"# Transition replay fallback for invalid direct Jira transitions\n\n## Context / Problem\n\nWhen rebar's target status is reachable in Jira only via intermediate states, the current\nreconciler attempts the direct end-state transition and, when Jira rejects it as illegal\n(handled around `dispatch_one.py` L402/445), the ticket drifts. But rebar records the\n*actual* hop sequence it took (e.g. open→in_progress→done); a Jira project that forbids\nopen→done directly may still allow open→in_progress→done. We want to replay rebar's real\nrecorded hops rather than give up on the first illegal direct transition. Self-healing\n(inventing hops Jira allows but rebar never took) was rejected; replay only mirrors hops\nthat actually happened in rebar.\n\n## Approach\n\nOn an illegal direct transition, fall back to **transition replay**: reconstruct rebar's\nrecorded status-hop sequence for the ticket, anchor on Jira's **current actual** status,\nand attempt each recorded hop in order using Jira's available-transitions API (the same\nAPI the direct path already queries). A hop is attempted only if it is (a) currently\navailable from Jira's present status and (b) has no un-fillable required field (no\nfield-guessing — a required field with no `create_defaults`/known value aborts). Any\nun-clean hop ⇒ fall back to **drift + warning** (today's terminal behavior). Replay is\nbest-effort and idempotent per pass: a partial advance is fine; the next pass re-anchors\non the new current status and continues. No new config axis — replay is behavior on the\nexisting transition path, gated by the S2 status mapping (each hop's target is resolved\nthrough the status map).\n\n## Scope\n\n- `src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/dispatch_one.py` — replay fallback in the\n  illegal-transition branch (~L402/445).\n- `tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/test_transition_replay.py` (new).\n\n## Testing\n\n- **Replay reaches end state (unit, faked transition API):** direct open→done is illegal\n  but open→in_progress and in_progress→done are available; assert both hops fire in order\n  and Jira reaches `done`.\n- **Un-clean hop drifts (failure path):** an intermediate hop is unavailable (or needs an\n  un-fillable required field); assert replay stops and the ticket drifts with a warning —\n  no partial-state crash, no field guessing.\n- **Re-anchor idempotence:** a second pass from a partially-advanced current status\n  continues from there rather than restarting — asserted on the hops attempted.\n- **No self-heal:** a hop rebar never recorded is never attempted even if Jira allows it —\n  asserted on the attempted-hop set.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [ ] An illegal direct transition triggers replay of rebar's recorded hops, anchored on\n  Jira's current status, reaching the end state when every hop is clean — verified by\n  `test_transition_replay.py::test_replay_reaches_end_state`.\n- [ ] An un-clean hop (unavailable or un-fillable required field) falls back to drift +\n  warning with no field guessing — verified by\n  `test_transition_replay.py::test_unclean_hop_drifts`.\n- [ ] Replay re-anchors on current status and is idempotent across passes — verified by\n  `test_transition_replay.py::test_replay_reanchors`.\n- [ ] Only rebar-recorded hops are attempted (no self-heal) — verified by\n  `test_transition_replay.py::test_no_selfheal_hops`.\n\nTest tier: **in-process unit with a faked transition API** — the oracle is the ordered set\nof transition calls issued and the resulting status / drift alert; a live tier is\nunnecessary because the decision logic is what's under test, and the Jira transition API is\na narrow injected boundary.","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[{"path":"src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/dispatch_one.py","reason":"transition replay fallback in illegal-transition branch"},{"path":"tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/test_transition_replay.py","reason":"new transition-replay tests"}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[["depends_on","438a-e1d9-29d3-4081"],["parent","3d7a-7795-efde-4df7"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":"3d7a-7795-efde-4df7","parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":[],"ticket_id":"d458-bb1e-cc63-42a6","ticket_type":"story","title":"Transition replay fallback for invalid direct Jira transitions","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["f0a71275-873e-482b-96f2-bb6cdb3b49d9","492cf506-9df7-4710-a4bf-0b887152031e","7b5dbb98-9ddb-43a7-94d5-51b7f3a66213"]},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1787301214825802001,"uuid":"1585d829-08cd-4941-a0b2-4c07a6906ef1"}